+- `11_obligation_map_and_target_absence.txt`
+- `12_semantic_relevance_and_mutations.txt`
+- `13_trusted_stage3_boundary_validation.txt`
+- `14_independent_stage4_zero_obligation_check.txt`
+
+VERDICT: PASS
+LEGITIMACY: LEGIT
